      "content": "thanks. i guess. it's just hard to find the \"gentle\" part of it. i'm sitting here in my car in the parking lot and i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if the noise just... stopped. if i didn't have to wake up and do it all again tomorrow. it feels like i've given everything i have and there's nothing left to give. like the lutter itself is just stupid at this point.",
