      "content": "the system is a disaster, but even that feels like too much energy to even be mad at. it's just... empty. i look at the people i'm trying to help and i don't see \"lives being saved\" anymore, i just see more suffering that i'm helping prolong. it feels like i'm just part of a cycle that shouldn't even be happening. sometimes i wonder if there's actually any point to any of this, or if we're all just fighting a losing battle that nobody asked for.",
